cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, cite it as below."
title: "Ecluna: detection limits for moving objects in SPHEREx"
abstract: >-
  A measurement of how deep SPHEREx can see a moving object in a small patch of
  sky, built for the NASA Space Apps Challenge 2026 challenge "Planet X and
  SPHEREx". The product reports a detection limit with confidence intervals and
  sample counts, and publishes the patches that failed.
type: software
license: Apache-2.0
version: "0.1.0"
authors:
